{"folder":null,"name":"Ablative Coating I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A layer of impact-absorbing nanocomposite material bonded to the inner surface of the armor chassis. Microscale shock absorbers distribute kinetic energy across the suit's structural lattice, reducing trauma transfer to the wearer. Increases maximum Hit Points by 5.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ablative-coating-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"ablative-coating","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":20}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"92e0cac9bc7f3575"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Ablative Coating II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An advanced multi-layer ablative coating using graded-density alloy composites that progressively absorb and redirect kinetic and thermal impact across the suit frame. A significant improvement over standard weave, substantially increasing the wearer's survivability in sustained firefights. Increases maximum Hit Points by 10.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ablative-coating-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"ablative-coating","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"f803f1772b198d3c"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Ablative Coating III","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Military-grade lattice shunting technology derived from dreadnought hull plating adapted for infantry scale. The coating actively redistributes impact forces through a reactive polymer mesh, dramatically expanding the trauma tolerance of the wearer's suit. Increases maximum Hit Points by 20.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ablative-coating-3","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"ablative-coating","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"a1741f934ab6be46"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Arc Resistance Grid I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A Faraday mesh woven into the suit's outer shell that diverts electrical charge around the wearer rather than through them. Provides meaningful protection against arc projectors, Geth electromagnetic discharges, and the Javelin sniper rifle's penetrating arc bolts. Provides resistance 5 to electricity damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"arc-resistance-grid-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"arc-resistance-grid","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"d37db9fbee9f841b"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Arc Resistance Grid II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A high-conductance superconducting mesh integrated throughout the suit structure, capable of safely shunting even sustained high-voltage arc discharge into the ground without harm to the wearer. Originally developed for Alliance engineers working around mass effect drive cores. Provides resistance 10 to electricity damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"arc-resistance-grid-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"arc-resistance-grid","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"5d1320aa2817b6e4"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Biotic Feedback Generator","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A dark energy resonance amplifier tuned specifically to biotic L5 implant frequencies. The device creates a sympathetic field loop that reinforces the user's own dark energy output, enhancing the precision and control of mass effect field manipulation. Developed by Sirta Foundation researchers studying elite biotic performance. Grants a +2 item bonus to biotic ability checks and attack rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires an active biotic implant.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"biotic-feedback-generator","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"biotic-feedback-generator","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"94079f9cb608cdab"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Cryo Resistance Lining I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An internal suit lining using phase-change thermal regulation materials that resist extreme cold by absorbing thermal energy from the environment before it can reach the wearer. Effective against cryo weapons, cryogenic grenade blasts, and the vacuum of space exposure. Provides resistance 5 to cold damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"cryo-resistance-lining-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"cryo-resistance-lining","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"ff32fdc5ecfbdeca"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Cryo Resistance Lining II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A full-suit cryogenic insulation system incorporating active thermal countermeasures — small resistance heating elements throughout the suit that engage automatically when temperature sensors detect hazardous cold. Originally developed for Alliance Marines operating in arctic and deep-space environments. Provides resistance 10 to cold damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"cryo-resistance-lining-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"cryo-resistance-lining","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"f2f7d1e57d1a8b76"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Damage Amplifier I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A targeting VI module integrated into the helmet's HUD system, providing continuous ballistic calculation and micro-adjustment recommendations that improve hit placement across all weapon types. The system's feedback loop tightens shot grouping and ensures impacts strike against target weak points rather than center mass. Grants a +1 item bonus to weapon damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"damage-amplifier-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"damage-amplifier","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"ec2da01a8bdba786"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Damage Amplifier II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An advanced ballistic VI suite integrating real-time target modeling, predictive movement algorithms, and kinetic coil feedback that optimizes round velocity for each trigger pull. The system substantially improves effective damage output across all weapon platforms by ensuring rounds strike optimal impact angles against barrier fields, armor weaves, and organic tissue. Grants a +2 item bonus to weapon damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"damage-amplifier-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"damage-amplifier","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"aeca97a13375cf6d"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Fire Resistance Layer I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A ceramic-composite thermal insulation layer bonded between the outer shell and the suit's inner padding. Designed to mitigate incendiary weapons, flamethrowers, and pyrotechnic explosives encountered in Terminus Systems operations. Provides resistance 5 to fire damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"fire-resistance-layer-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"fire-resistance-layer","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"7cffc0c95a7d827f"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Fire Resistance Layer II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A reinforced thermal protection system using active heat-sink channels that continuously wick thermal energy away from vulnerable suit components. Provides meaningful protection against even the heaviest incendiary ordnance and sustained flamethrower exposure. Provides resistance 10 to fire damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"fire-resistance-layer-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"fire-resistance-layer","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"d5f6f8aa57a4b9ea"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Kinetic Dampeners","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A micro-suspension system installed in the joints and weight-bearing structures of the armor that absorbs and counters the movement resistance created by the suit's mass. By dynamically compensating for the armor's inertia, the wearer experiences significantly less impediment to agility-dependent tasks. Reduces the armor's check penalty by 1.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"kinetic-dampeners","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"kinetic-dampeners","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"952d4fd9bdea1ec7"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Melee Actuators I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Motorized exoskeletal actuators in the arm and shoulder sections of the suit that engage automatically during close-combat strikes, adding mechanical force multiplied through the suit's frame to the wearer's natural striking power. Originally developed for Krogan-operated hardsuits, scaled for human and humanoid physiology. Grants a +1 item bonus to melee damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"melee-actuators-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"melee-actuators","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"2da151e789c1e1b1"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Melee Actuators II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Heavy-duty combat actuators that replace the standard elbow and shoulder servo assemblies with hydraulic force amplifiers, dramatically increasing the kinetic energy delivered in each close-combat strike. The system is tuned for combat applications rather than general movement, meaning strikes hit with a force well beyond what the wearer's musculature alone could generate. Grants a +2 item bonus to melee damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"melee-actuators-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"melee-actuators","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"bf35abc34a013151"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Power Amplifier I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A neural interface booster and omni-tool amplification module that increases the output power of both tech and biotic abilities. For tech users, it improves omni-tool field generation efficiency; for biotics, it enhances the dark energy focusing resonators built into the suit. Grants a +1 item bonus to ability/spell damage rolls (tech and biotic powers).</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"power-amplifier-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"power-amplifier","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"fbf0dd9843989856"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Power Amplifier II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A high-performance multicore amplifier system that significantly increases the destructive output of both tech and biotic powers. The module includes a dedicated power draw circuit that prioritizes ability generation over secondary suit functions when activated, ensuring maximum energy delivery to the field effect. Grants a +2 item bonus to ability/spell damage rolls (tech and biotic powers).</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"power-amplifier-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"power-amplifier","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"6b2942bc25d63a0b"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Precision Targeting","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A biometric targeting overlay system that combines thermal imaging, structural weak-point mapping, and real-time ballistic compensation to guide rounds into joints, optics, and other critical target vulnerabilities. When properly applied, the system transforms a competent shot into a devastating one. When you make a targeted attack (aiming for a specific location or vulnerability), you deal an additional 1d6 precision damage on a hit.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"precision-targeting","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"precision-targeting","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"35b4c69af46013bf"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Recharge Accelerator I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An auxiliary power routing module that prioritizes barrier recharge current when the kinetic field drops below threshold. By bypassing standard load-balancing protocols, it shaves one full recharge cycle from the downtime between shield collapse and restoration. Reduces kinetic barrier recharge delay by 1 round.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"recharge-accelerator-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"recharge-accelerator","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"4eb92f4704d73d7f"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Recharge Accelerator II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A redundant field generator system that maintains a secondary charge reservoir specifically for emergency barrier restoration. When the primary kinetic field collapses, the reserve dumps its stored charge directly into the projectors, dramatically cutting recovery time. The fastest shield recharge enhancement available without a full hardsuit overhaul. Reduces kinetic barrier recharge delay by 2 rounds.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"recharge-accelerator-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"recharge-accelerator","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"850904caeb1b993c"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Recharge Module I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A power cycling optimization module that streamlines the energy routing between the suit's main reactor cell and its ability-generation systems. By eliminating inefficiencies in the standard cooling and recharge loop, it meaningfully reduces the downtime between power uses. Reduces power recharge time by 1 round.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"recharge-module-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"recharge-module","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"37e44e47b76ff306"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Recharge Module II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A high-capacity power cell and smart routing module that dramatically accelerates the cooldown cycle for tech and biotic abilities. The system includes a predictive charge algorithm that begins the recharge sequence earlier in the activation window, shaving significant time from consecutive power use. Reduces power recharge time by 2 rounds.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"recharge-module-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"recharge-module","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"1e9a7283b647bb81"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Servo Actuators I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Leg and hip servo motors that actively assist the wearer's walking and running gait, effectively carrying a portion of the suit's weight and adding mechanical thrust to each stride. Originally developed for heavy-labor hardsuit use in low-gravity environments, the combat adaptation provides a meaningful increase in ground speed during tactical movement. Increases your Speed by 5 feet.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"servo-actuators-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"servo-actuators","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"20b0abcf97109068"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Servo Actuators II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>High-output military-grade leg actuators with full-body kinetic assist, including hip, knee, and ankle joints that work in concert to multiply the wearer's natural stride length and frequency. The system includes a combat movement VI that anticipates directional changes and pre-loads actuator tension, making the suit feel almost weightless during sprints and direction changes. Increases your Speed by 10 feet.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"servo-actuators-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"servo-actuators","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"b28ea1a0bb1c9d9a"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Shield Capacitor I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An supplementary kinetic barrier emitter cell that augments the output of the armor's existing barrier projectors. The additional capacitor stores charge between barrier cycles, allowing the field to sustain a higher maximum strength before collapsing under fire. Increases kinetic barrier pool by 5.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"shield-capacitor-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"shield-capacitor","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"76c502366505826d"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Shield Capacitor II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A high-density barrier capacitor array using superconducting loop technology to sustain a substantially larger kinetic field than standard emitter hardware. The expanded field envelope intercepts more incoming mass-accelerated rounds before collapsing, giving the wearer a meaningful advantage in sustained engagements. Increases kinetic barrier pool by 10.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"shield-capacitor-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"shield-capacitor","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"4a9aafc49808edd2"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Tech Integrator","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A custom heuristics module that integrates directly with the wearer's omni-tool, replacing the standard combat VI with a specialized offensive technology suite. The module pre-computes optimal hack vectors, incinerate plasma trajectories, and combat drone deployment windows, allowing the user to execute tech abilities with significantly improved effectiveness and accuracy. Grants a +2 item bonus to tech ability checks and attack rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires an omni-tool.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tech-integrator","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"tech-integrator","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"130abfeddd93c5f0"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Trauma Module I","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A medi-gel dispenser and automated triage system integrated into the armor's inner layer. Pressure sensors detect tissue trauma and trigger controlled medi-gel release directly against damaged areas, stimulating rapid cellular repair throughout combat. Grants Fast Healing 1 (regain 1 HP at the start of each of your turns while above 0 HP).</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"trauma-module-1","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"trauma-module","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"48c3128d88fefc1c"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Trauma Module II","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/amulet.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An advanced battlefield triage system combining medi-gel infusion, nanoscale wound sealants, and a medical VI that monitors vitals and prioritizes treatment in real time. The system operates continuously during combat, aggressively countering trauma as fast as it occurs. Grants Fast Healing 2 (regain 2 HP at the start of each of your turns while above 0 HP).</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"trauma-module-2","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"trauma-module","bulk":{"value":0},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"usage":{"value":"worn"},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unknown Mod","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/worn-item.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"d7a078a32b067211"}
